  ^Raid_Boss_special_chance_base^/?i^Raid_Boss_special_chance_base^/i^Raid_Boss_special_chance_base^/
  ^Raid_Boss_start_delay^/?i^Raid_Boss_start_delay^/i^Raid_Boss_start_delay^/
  ^RaidBoss_ACM_rewards^/?i^RaidBoss_ACM_rewards^/i^RaidBoss_ACM_rewards^/
